        <div class="left-column">
            <div class="section">
                <h2>Research Focus</h2>
                <p><strong>AI agents that absorb human expertise through context rather than fine-tuning.</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Context-based adaptation vs. traditional fine-tuning</li>
                    <li>Capturing expert knowledge nuance</li>
                    <li>Expertise distillation frameworks</li>
                </ul>

                <div class="highlight-box">
                    <p>Enhancing rather than replacing developer judgment</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h2>Core Framework</h2>
                <p>Expertise elicited across four dimensions:</p>
                <div class="framework-grid">
                    <div class="framework-item">
                        <h4>Task Distribution</h4>
                        <p>How work is allocated and organized</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="framework-item">
                        <h4>Procedural Workflow</h4>
                        <p>Step-by-step processes and methodologies</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="framework-item">
                        <h4>Output Verification</h4>
                        <p>Quality control and validation approaches</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="framework-item">
                        <h4>Automation Granularity</h4>
                        <p>Determining appropriate automation levels</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="right-column">
            <div class="section">
                <h2>Philosophy</h2>
                <h3>Human-Centered Coding Agents</h3>
                <p>Advocating for AI systems that <strong>augment</strong> human capabilities rather than replace them.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Preserve developer judgment and expertise</li>
                    <li>Create collaborative human-AI workflows</li>
                    <li>Balance automation with human insight</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h2>Evaluation Methods</h2>
                <p>Comprehensive testing approach combining:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Simulated benchmarks</strong> for controlled evaluation</li>
                    <li><strong>Real-world deployment</strong> with human experts</li>
                    <li><strong>Writing & visual design tasks</strong> as test domains</li>
                    <li><strong>In-the-wild deployment</strong> scenarios</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h2>Communication Style</h2>
                <p>Favoring clarity, artistry, and precision:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Vivid metaphors that illuminate concepts</li>
                    <li>Active verbs that drive momentum</li>
                    <li>Concise prose that respects attention</li>
                    <li>Smooth transitions that guide thinking</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <footer>
            <div class="style-badges">
                <span class="badge">Context-Based Learning</span>
                <span class="badge">Human-Centered AI</span>
                <span class="badge">Expertise Distillation</span>
                <span class="badge">Concise Communication</span>
            </div>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
